             <div class="col-12 mb-3 mb-md-5 text-center">
                 <h3>Join hands with AstroKumbh – where faith meets tradition, and rituals bring transformation.</h3>
                 <hr class="short" />
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p>Astang Bhairav is one of the eight (Ashta) forms of Lord Bhairav, who is the ultimate protector of the universe. The word “Astang” refers to the eight (8) forms of Bhairav. These forms are considered extremely powerful, and each has a unique power and significance to protect the devotees from different types of negative energies, enemies, and spiritual blockages. Astang Bhairav Anushthan is a sacred ritual designed to invoke the divine blessings of all the eight forms of Lord Bhairav to ensure peace, success, and protection in life.</p>
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Each form of Astang Bhairav represents different qualities, such as courage, fearlessness, protection, prosperity, and victory over obstacles. Performing this anushthan invokes the complete energy of Lord Bhairav, ensuring that all your challenges in life are overcome with divine blessings.</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Why Perform Astang Bhairav Anushthan?</b>
                 <p>Protection from Negative Energies
Astang Bhairav Anushthan helps in removing evil influences, black magic, and negative energies from your life.
</p>
                 <p>Protection from Enemies and Harmful Forces
This anushthan shields you from physical and mental harm, enemies, and external negative influences.</p>
                 <p>Success in Business and Career
If you are facing obstacles in your career or business, this anushthan opens the doors to success, growth, and prosperity.</p>
                 <p>Resolution of Family and Relationship Issues
Astang Bhairav is also invoked to restore harmony, peace, and unity within families and relationships.
</p>
                 <p>Spiritual Growth and Advancement
It is performed for spiritual progress, mental clarity, and inner peace.</p>
                  <p>Remedy for Financial Problems
This ritual is known to eliminate financial difficulties and promote wealth and prosperity.</p>
                 <p>Overcoming Health Issues
Astang Bhairav Anushthan is also done to seek protection and healing from health issues and chronic ailments.
</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Rituals Performed in Astang Bhairav Anushthan:</b>
                 <p>Invocation of Lord Ganesha – To remove all obstacles before the start of the ritual.
</p>
                 <p>Establishment of Astang Bhairav Idol – Placement of the eight forms of Bhairav idols or pictures for worship.
</p>
                 <p>Mantra Chanting – Recitation of Astang Bhairav Mantra (ॐ अष्टांग भैरवाय नमः)</p>
                 <p>Offering of Sacred Herbs and Flowers – Flowers, herbs like Basil, and Bilva leaves are offered to Lord Bhairav.</p>
                 <p>Lighting of Sacred Lamps – Diya (oil lamps) are lit during the ritual to symbolize the removal of darkness.</p>
                  <p>Havan (Sacred Fire Ritual) – Special offerings are made into the sacred fire for divine blessings.</p>
                 <p>Offerings of Milk, Honey, and Ghee – Ritual bathing and anointing of the Astang Bhairav idols.</p>
                 <p>Bathed in Sacred Water – The idols of Astang Bhairav are bathed in holy water to purify them.</p>
                 <p>Chanting of Bhairav Ashtakshari Mantra – ॐ भैरवाय नमः mantra chanting for invoking divine blessings</p>
                 <p>Aarti and Bhajans – Recitation of Aarti and devotional songs to please Lord Bhairav</p>
                 <p>Charity (Brahmin Bhojan) – Offering food to the Brahmins and the poor as a part of charity.</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Benefits of Astang Bhairav Anushthan:</b>
                 <p>Complete Protection from Evil Energies, Enemies, and Negative Influences</p>
                 <p>Financial Success and Wealth generation</p>
                 <p>Business Prosperity and Career Growth</p>
                 <p>Resolution of Family Conflicts, ensuring peace and harmony in relationships.</p>
                 <p>Courage and Fearlessness to overcome life's challenges and obstacles.</p>
                  <p>Healing from Health Problems, especially chronic ailments and stress</p>
                 <p>Spiritual Awakening and Mental Clarity to make wise decisions.</p>
                 <p>Victory over Challenges and achieving success in all areas of life</p>
                 <p>Removal of Unwanted Karmic Effects and past life blockages</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <b>Special Services for Astang Bhairav Anushthan:</b>
                 <p>Personalized Astang Bhairav Anushthan
We provide a customized Astang Bhairav Anushthan based on your birth chart, addressing your personal obstacles and challenges, whether in career, health, or relationships.</p>
                 <p>Astang Bhairav Abhishek and Havan
We perform Abhishek (ritual bathing) and Havan (sacred fire ritual) for invoking Lord Bhairav’s blessings in your life.</p>
                 <p>Astang Bhairav Mantra Chanting
For those seeking to chant the powerful Astang Bhairav Mantras on their own, we provide proper guidance, books, and the correct pronunciation for effective results.
</p>
                 <p>Astang Bhairav Remedies for Financial Prosperity
Special remedies for wealth and financial success are included, such as offering gold, silver, and precious gemstones during the ritual.
</p>
                 <p>Astang Bhairav Puja for Family Welfare
For individuals facing relationship and family issues, this anushthan is performed to bring peace and prosperity to families and relationships</p>
                  <p>Healing Services for Health and Mental Peace
A detailed healing session along with the anushthan to promote mental peace, healing, and health recovery.</p>
                 <p>Live Streaming of Astang Bhairav Anushthan
For devotees who cannot be present physically, we offer live streaming services, allowing them to participate from any location.
</p>
                 
